## Procedure (P1-P7, on the D-GS3 chain)
P1 intake: photograph, article ID, as-built dimensions; fabrication
deviations recorded, never adjusted away. P2 conditioning 24 h at
23 +- 2 C, 50 +- 10% RH. P3 mass x3, median, balance 25 kg / 0.1 g
class calibrated on the day, +-0.1%. P4 volume by TWO methods -
dimensional 5x5 grid and Archimedes displacement (article sealed,
sealant tared) - accord within 1.0% or the MEASUREMENT is invalid
(metrology rejection, not a design kill); +-0.5% carried. P5 blind
seat: computed from the raw (M, V) by the Pulse Chip only; the
window, the design seat and the expected classes are not displayed
until the three splits are written. P6 verdicts per the
preregistration above. P7 raw readings filed with the verdict - a
verdict without its raw readings does not exist.

## Budget (computed in-run)
Density uncertainty 0.51% -> split sigma 0.00127 nats.
Decision margins at design seats: B1 to the shell floor
8.0 sigma (tight side); B1 to the window bottom
66.1 sigma; B0 control 26.1 sigma from the window;
B2 control 92.1 sigma from the floor. The bench decides
every class outright at design seats.

